The test `['org.apache.commons.cli.bug.BugCLI162Test.testInfiniteLoop()']` failed.
The test looks like:

```java
42 :     public void testInfiniteLoop() {
43 :         HelpFormatter formatter = new HelpFormatter();
44 :         formatter.setWidth(20);
45 :         formatter.printHelp("app", options); // used to hang & crash
46 :     }
```

Current bug report: {'summary': 'infinite loop in the wrapping code of HelpFormatter', 'description': 'If there is not enough space to display a word on a single line, HelpFormatter goes into a infinite loops until the JVM crashes with an OutOfMemoryError.\nTest case:\n```\nOptions options = new Options();\noptions.addOption("h", "help", false, "This is a looooong description");\nHelpFormatter formatter = new HelpFormatter();\nformatter.setWidth(20);\nformatter.printHelp("app", options); // hang & crash\n`'}

